  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Weather Report Suite** (1 review): Reviewer describes the Weather Report Suite as stretched out and expansive [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Weather Report Suite [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **gd1973-08-04.165907.sbd.miller.flac1648** (recommended): soundboard; 4 songs; 30 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer finds the soundboard comparable to any recording, with subtle yet deep harmonies [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The date tag marks the first day of the recording session at Record Plant [1]\n- Reviewer calls the Wake of the Flood songs tight in this performance [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **gd1973-08-04.165907.sbd.miller.flac1648**: transferred by Mixed and Mastered by Charlie Miller  October 3, 2023; source: Dead Net Mixer > Tascam SS-CDR200 (16-bit/48k) > Samplitude Pro X6 Suite > FLAC/16 [1]. Also: This show ID was used for the dead.net Playing in the Band home mixes, where users adjusted levels and panning [1]",
